Loop static self-branches in generated VU1 C++ (AOT and DLL); mirror direct self-body jumps in the x64 JIT.
Complete exit/entry bookkeeping exactly once, including budget, stop and depth-limit exits.
Keep generic chaining and interpreter fallbacks; no guest instruction or floating-point semantics change.
No gameplay performance measurement is claimed by this patch.

